<title>UK: Baltic Freight Index fell five points to 1,259.</title>
<headline>Baltic Freight Index fell five points to 1,259.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,259 today from 1,264 on April 28, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals 1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1346    12.221	  1342    12.183</p>
<p>   1a   1235  9357.000	  1253  9492.000</p>
